    "detailed_description": "Help Ramis cure an enchanted forest of a mysterious affliction and save Mossglen, in this magical, healing quest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385370/extras/9a3175271dbbf8b1ea3216462aafa81a.avif?t=1726031617\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A narrative-driven, single-player adventure game with a charming cast of characters and a touching story of self-discovery<br></li><li>An enchanted forest teeming with spirits and secrets  <br></li><li>Decision-based difficulty, where your decisions have a direct impact on the difficulty of the game<br></li><li>Over 2 hours of original music with beautiful orchestrated piano and catchy beats<br></li><li>Capybaras</li></ul><br>The story is simple - healing a corroding forest - but the true reasons behind the Corrosion and what lies ahead may not be so straight-forward. You and your magic staff may be the key to stopping this evil before it turns the land barren. <br><br><i>Can you stop the Corrosion before it's too late?</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385370/extras/6ec486b6c44b0dd4b7477edcd0484ec4.avif?t=1726031617\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Help Ramis cure an enchanted forest of a mysterious affliction and save Mossglen, in this magical, healing quest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385370/extras/9a3175271dbbf8b1ea3216462aafa81a.avif?t=1726031617\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A narrative-driven, single-player adventure game with a charming cast of characters and a touching story of self-discovery<br></li><li>An enchanted forest teeming with spirits and secrets  <br></li><li>Decision-based difficulty, where your decisions have a direct impact on the difficulty of the game<br></li><li>Over 2 hours of original music with beautiful orchestrated piano and catchy beats<br></li><li>Capybaras</li></ul><br>The story is simple - healing a corroding forest - but the true reasons behind the Corrosion and what lies ahead may not be so straight-forward. You and your magic staff may be the key to stopping this evil before it turns the land barren. <br><br><i>Can you stop the Corrosion before it's too late?</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385370/extras/6ec486b6c44b0dd4b7477edcd0484ec4.avif?t=1726031617\" /></span>",
